     5245   ON CHOOSE OF B-delivery IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     5246   DO:
     5247     run cus/pardeliv.w
     5248         (input        parParentproc
     5249         ,input        if t-action = "lkp" then 'ПРОСМОТР':U else t-action
     5250         ,input        "ord" + g#type
     5251         ,input        loc-store-type
     5252         ,input        loc-store-code
     5253         ,input        loc-cli-type
     5254         ,input        loc-cli-code
     5255         ,input-output v-deliv-type-code
     5256         ,input-output v-point-obj-code
     5257         ,input-output v-point-obj-db-num
     5258         ,input-output v-point-cli-code
     5259         ,input-output v-point-cli-db-num
     5260         ,input-output v-transport-host-code
     5261         ,input-output v-transport-cli-type
     5262         ,input-output v-transport-cli-code
     5263         ,input-output v-transport-contract
     5264         ,input-output v-transport-condition
     5265         ,input-output v-transport-value
     5266         ,input-output v-transport-sum
     5267         ,input-output v-transport-vat
     5268            ) no-error  .
     5269            if error-status :error then message
     5270              vss-workfile vss-revision vss-description skip
     5271              error-status :get-message(1) skip
     5272              return-value skip
     5273              "Ошибка"
     5274              view-as alert-box error
     5275            .
     5276   END.
     5277   on choose of b-gds-prt in frame dialog-frame
     5278   do:
