     5541   end.
     5542   on value-changed of a-n-c in frame dialog-frame do:
     5543     run proc-valchg-a-n-c in this-procedure  no-error.
     5544     return no-apply.
     5545   end.
     5546   on any-printable of br-docs in frame dialog-frame do:
     5547     run proc-any-printable-br-docs in this-procedure   no-error.
     5548     return no-apply.
