    10964               tmp#zakaz.cli-qnty  :read-only in browse br-docs =  true
    10965               tmp#zakaz.price-cli :read-only in browse br-docs =  true  no-error .
    10966           run chg-action  in this-procedure  .
    10967           run enable_ui_2  in this-procedure  .
